<title>BULGARIA: Bulgaria offers 10 bln levs 3-mth T-bills Monday.</title>
<headline>Bulgaria offers 10 bln levs 3-mth T-bills Monday.</headline>
<dateline>SOFIA 1997-06-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bulgaria's Finance Ministry will offer 10 billion levs of three-month discount T-bills with no minimum acceptable price set in advance at an auction on Monday, the central bank said.</p>
<p>Details of the issue follow:</p>
<p> Issue number	   BG3037797001</p>
<p> Maturity		 three months</p>
<p> Par value		10 bln levs</p>
<p> Auction date	   June 9</p>
<p> Issue date	     June 11</p>
<p> Maturity date	  September 10</p>
<p>-- Sofia Newsroom, (++359-2) 91188</p>
</text>
